#!/usr/bin/env python3
# apply_pf_net_after_tax.py — fence PF_NET_AFTER_TAX_20260930
# (requires LOT_COMP_TAX_20260924 — the per-run FY tax schedule — and PF_FAVOURITES_20260830)
#
# Portfolio on NET AFTER TAX, plus a month scoreboard.
#   • runs table: "Net after tax" column next to Net (Compare's figure:
#     net − tax withdrawn − tax due; "—" when the run has no tax option)
#   • every portfolio figure — combined net, max DD, DD reduction, return ÷ DD,
#     per-strategy contribution, equity curves, correlation, monthly table —
#     uses net after tax for runs that have it, pre-tax net for runs that
#     don't (said so in the header). Each FY's stamped tax is spread over that
#     FY's trades pro rata ((FY net − FY tax) ÷ FY net), so strategy totals
#     equal Compare's "Net after tax" to the rupee and no month changes colour;
#     a losing FY carries its loss forward untaxed, as in the engine.
#   • Basis switch in the results header: Net after tax | Net (pre-tax),
#     remembered; per-strategy table gains a Tax column (hover: pre-tax net)
#   • Monthly tab: scoreboard above the table, per strategy and combined —
#     Green months, Red months, % green, Longest red run (consecutive
#     months, hover for the span), Worst and Best month, No-trade months.
#     Months are now calendar-continuous: a month a strategy did not trade
#     shows "—" and counts as no-trade (never green or red; it ends a red run).
#
#   frontend/src/pages/backtest/Portfolio.jsx   (anchored edits)
#   tools/tests/portfolio_tax/                  (new: 26 checks, run below —
#     fixture tax stamps come from the real backend fy_tax_schedule)
#
# Deploy: ./desktop/build-scalp.sh frontend
#
# Run ONLY this script:
#   cd /Users/anbu/dev/scalp-app && python3 apply_pf_net_after_tax.py [--allow-dirty]
